Hi Sam,
This is a very thoughtful email, I'd be quite happy to talk to you some mor=
e about the host program. I'm about to start my weekend but I will be avail=
able starting Wednesday if you'd like to set up a phone call? Usually takes=
 about 30 minutes, just to get to know you a little better and answer any q=
uestions you may have. For now I have attached a document with some more in=
formation about the program in our specific Management Unit (administrative=
 divisions of Oregon State Parks. I oversee the volunteer program for both =
Umpqua Lighthouse and Tugman). I have also included brochures for both park=
s and the host site directories which have more information about the ameni=
ties.

It would be helpful to know what months you are hoping to schedule. If you'=
re wanting to start immediately, I do have an open position from January 1 =
- 31 at Tugman, which is the Yurt Cleaner position that is described in the=
 info document.

Warm regards,

[OPRD-shield_RGB_R BLACK]


Franki Allegra (She/her) |  Park Ranger + Volunteer Service Leader
